- Sibling carves of the same ticket written in the same session: `KS-1364-nft-record-estimate`, `KS-1364-nft-verify`, `KS-1364-analytics-reports` (held 10:0x, accepted by Wednesday), and `KS-1364-billing`, `KS-1364-m365`, `KS-1364-onedrive` (this batch). All six product goldens and all six YAML companions apply strictly in sequence on one tree (measured); they are meant to go up as ONE PR.

